  the exact answer is 20. It never allows too many. Neither tested case uses a window on that 0.1 grid, which is why the
  tests pass. The fix would be exact [38;5;153mFraction[39m arithmetic in [38;5;153msimulate[39m, plus a new test. Tell me if you want it.

